WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.036
Welcome to Konnektora.

2
00:00:02.121 --> 00:00:05.260
Here, discovery starts
with shared interests.

3
00:00:05.345 --> 00:00:08.925
Explore events, venues,
and topics to find communities

4
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.700
that match your interests.

5
00:00:11.770 --> 00:00:14.016
Learn more about an event,

6
00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:15.990
review the participation requirements,

7
00:00:16.074 --> 00:00:18.815
and connect with people
who share your interests.

8
00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:22.348
In this guide, we'll explore discovery,
profiles, communities,

9
00:00:22.433 --> 00:00:25.633
events, and privacy tools.

10
00:00:25.717 --> 00:00:28.580
To get started, use the event,

11
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:32.048
venue, and interest links
on the home page.

12
00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:35.715
Tags bring people
with shared interests together.

13
00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:38.948
Search for a topic,
open the relevant tag page,

14
00:00:39.033 --> 00:00:41.948
and explore posts related to it.

15
00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:45.154
Adding interests to your
profile helps you create a profile

16
00:00:45.233 --> 00:00:47.633
that reflects who you are.

17
00:00:47.733 --> 00:00:51.067
From here,
you can discover events and other members

18
00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:52.782
who share your interests.

19
00:00:52.867 --> 00:00:57.642
When using Konnektora,
you don't have to stick to what's popular.

20
00:00:57.727 --> 00:01:00.895
Start by choosing topics
you're genuinely curious about.

21
00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:03.720
When you visit another member's profile,

22
00:01:03.798 --> 00:01:08.849
you can run a Mutualism analysis
to see what you have in common,

23
00:01:08.934 --> 00:01:11.648
how you might connect with them,

24
00:01:11.733 --> 00:01:15.382
and which events you might enjoy together.

25
00:01:15.467 --> 00:01:21.373
The more complete your interests are
and the more you engage with content,

26
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.220
the better our AI can
tailor these insights to you.

27
00:01:24.305 --> 00:01:26.049
When you create an account,

28
00:01:26.134 --> 00:01:29.482
your profile becomes your
personal space within the community.

29
00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:34.548
Customize your username, photo,
and the information you'd like to share.

30
00:01:34.633 --> 00:01:39.938
The interests on your profile give others
a starting point for getting to know you.

31
00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.515
Don't create an account
using someone else's identity,

32
00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:44.433
and keep your login credentials secure.

33
00:01:44.533 --> 00:01:47.382
Remember to save your changes

34
00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:49.733
when updating your
account or profile settings.

35
00:01:49.822 --> 00:01:53.063
The availability of Google
and Facebook sign-in options

36
00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:55.198
depends on provider permissions.

37
00:01:55.300 --> 00:02:00.707
You can also quickly exchange
profiles with someone using either

38
00:02:00.791 --> 00:02:04.783
the QR or NFC option on
your Member Card page.

39
00:02:04.867 --> 00:02:10.296
One of you simply needs to
scan the QR code or tap via NFC.

40
00:02:10.381 --> 00:02:14.315
Before deciding to attend an event,
review its details page.

41
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:17.848
The date, time zone, location,
and participation requirements

42
00:02:17.933 --> 00:02:19.800
are important when making your plans.

43
00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:22.048
Along with public events,

44
00:02:22.133 --> 00:02:26.375
some events may require
organizer approval or an invitation.

45
00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:31.915
Venue pages let you discover the community
and events associated with each venue.

46
00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:34.848
Sharing your location is optional.

47
00:02:34.933 --> 00:02:38.185
You can also create your own event.

48
00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:40.594
Your event is personalized

49
00:02:40.678 --> 00:02:43.515
and shown to users whose
interests are a good match.

50
00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:48.833
You can also invite attendees
recommended for your event by AI.

51
00:02:48.907 --> 00:02:52.715
On Konnektora, a topic can be
the start of a conversation.

52
00:02:52.800 --> 00:02:56.282
Explore posts about tags,
events, and venues.

53
00:02:56.367 --> 00:02:58.405
Join the conversation
by sharing your comments

54
00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:00.215
and experiences where appropriate.

55
00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:01.982
When messaging other members,

56
00:03:02.067 --> 00:03:06.148
respect their privacy
and the community guidelines.

57
00:03:06.233 --> 00:03:10.948
If you come across problematic content,
you can use the reporting tools.

58
00:03:11.033 --> 00:03:13.429
If you're unsure how to proceed,

59
00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:18.933
browse the Help Center or contact the
support team through the Contact page.

60
00:03:19.028 --> 00:03:23.448
You can manage your visibility,
and notification preferences in Settings.

61
00:03:23.533 --> 00:03:26.248
Consider what information
you want to share.

62
00:03:26.333 --> 00:03:29.548
Don't post sensitive information
in public areas.

63
00:03:29.633 --> 00:03:32.215
You can find more
information about the service

64
00:03:32.300 --> 00:03:34.767
on the Privacy Policy
and Terms of Use pages.

65
00:03:34.867 --> 00:03:38.948
Deactivating your account
does not mean all your data is deleted.

66
00:03:39.033 --> 00:03:41.948
For deletion requests,
follow the separate deletion guidelines.

67
00:03:42.033 --> 00:03:44.748
Konnektora is currently
in controlled beta.

68
00:03:44.833 --> 00:03:47.191
Your first step could
be choosing an interest

69
00:03:47.276 --> 00:03:50.166
and discovering
an experience that speaks to you.

